<title>USA: Dell sees computer systems market growing.</title>
<headline>Dell sees computer systems market growing.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp said it believes the outlook for growth in the overall computer systems market continues to be robust, with rich opportunities for continued success.</p>
<p>The company earlier reported significantly higher fourth quarter and fiscal year sales and earnings, beating First Call's fourth quarter mean estimate of $0.83 by almost $0.20 per share.</p>
<p>Dell reported fourth quarter earnings per share of $1.01, up from the $0.35 per share it reported a year-earlier.</p>
</text>
